#
# pce_strat, a block: general planning from the paraconsistent decision
# engines (games, logistics, scheduling, business and negotiation; never
# weapons targeting). Options against scenarios whose likelihoods are exact
# intervals lo/den..hi/den; three rules vote (best lower expected payoff,
# best worst case, least regret) and a split vote is BOTH, not one rule's
# answer. Advisory: a person decides.
zxblock 1
id       pce_strat
name     Paraconsistent strategy
version  1.0.0
# TRUE when all three rules pick the same option, BOTH when they split,
# NEITHER when no option is allowed.
provides decide truth payoff nopt lo hi den
logic    c decide <<
strat.decide
.
# The option most rules pick (ties: the lowest), or -1.
provides leader num payoff nopt lo hi den
logic    c leader <<
strat.leader
.
# Several estimates of each side's walk-away point: a deal under every
# estimate with one common price range TRUE, under none FALSE, else BOTH.
provides zopa truth seller_min buyer_max
logic    c zopa <<
strat.zopa
.
